    "long_instructions": "# Polishing the App\r\n\r\n1.  **Identify Edge Cases:** Prompt the AI to find weaknesses in your code. You might ask:\r\n      * *What are potential edge cases for my filtering system?*\r\n      * *How do I handle situations where the data is missing a value?*\r\n2.  **Handle Errors:** Update your JavaScript with conditional logic (`if/else`) to fix at least two issues.\r\n      * **Note:** Common fixes include converting text to `toLowerCase()` before comparing, or checking if a value exists (`!== undefined`) before displaying it.\r\n3.  **Final Polish:** Add comments to explain your code sections (e.g., `// Filter Logic`, `// Event Listeners`). Run your app one last time to ensure the Undo button, Reset button, and filters all work together smoothly."
  },
